cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bayesian Hierarchical Analysis of Soil Nutrient Vertical Profiles"
abstract: >
  Bayesian hierarchical model for soil nutrient (SOC, N, P) vertical depth profiles
  in 40 Tanzanian agricultural fields. Uses a multivariate random effects structure
  with random intercepts and slopes and a 6D LKJ covariance, implemented in Stan
  via cmdstanr. Includes projpred variable selection and robustness checks.
